<title>JAPAN: Matsudo Kosan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsudo Kosan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.57		vs	    1.73</p>
<p> Operating	  356    million	  vs	  507    million</p>
<p> Current	    556    million	  vs	  770    million</p>
<p> Net		  302    million	  vs	  385    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.38 yen	  vs	   13.23 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsudo Kosan Co Ltd leases a bicycle race course and real estate.</p>
</text>
